  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tCapium Hub\n\t\tCapium Hub Client Information\n\n### Client information - Creating sales and purchase invoices\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 23 Jul, 2021 at 11:46 AM\n\n\t\tLocation:\n\nSales invoice \n\nHub module >> Sales >> Invoice >> Raise invoice \n\nPurchase invoice\n\nHub module >> Purchases >> Purchases >> Record purchase \n\nVideo Tutorial:\n\nClick here to watch how to create sales and purchase invoices \n\nHelp Guide:\n\nYour clients can raise sales and purchase invoices from their side by logging in and going into the Hub module.\n\nSales Invoice\n\nNavigate to 'Sales' and then 'Invoices'.\n\nTo create a new sales invoice click on 'Raise Invoice'.\n\nEnter in the details of the invoice and click on 'Save'.\n\nPurchase Invoice \n\nNavigate to 'Purchases' and go into the 'Purchases' tab.\n\nTo create a new invoice, click on 'Record Purchases'. \n\nEnter in the details of the invoice and click on 'Save'.\n\nOnce your clients have created the invoices, they should reflect in the bookkeeping module.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000117301\">Capium Hub</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000195364\">Capium Hub Client Information</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">Client information - Creating sales and purchase invoices\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Fri, 23 Jul, 2021 at 11:46 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Location:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u>Sales invoice&nbsp;</u></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Hub module &gt;&gt; Sales &gt;&gt; Invoice &gt;&gt; Raise invoice&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u>Purchase invoice</u></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Hub module &gt;&gt; Purchases &gt;&gt; Purchases &gt;&gt; Record purchase&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Video Tutorial:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/432036793c92439fa0f9bd153d4726bb\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Click here to watch how to create sales and purchase invoices&nbsp;</a></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong><u>Help Guide:</u></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Your clients can raise sales and purchase invoices from their side by logging in and going into the Hub module.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135096399/original/L45p7_WvqEmYn7AeqwZq8A3Q5VVDMfGAnw.png?1626874284\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135096399\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u dir=\"ltr\">Sales Invoice</u></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to 'Sales' and then 'Invoices'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\">To create a new sales invoice click on 'Raise Invoice'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135097806/original/j8whu5yyy6pPzHWHYJfUd-aCXuHUpFydug.png?1626874939\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135097806\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Enter in the details of the invoice and click on 'Save'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135097903/original/imWhzhkOWko9NBsOXRJb742BZpKenMsPCw.png?1626874991\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135097903\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><u>Purchase Invoice</u>&nbsp;</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to 'Purchases' and go into the 'Purchases' tab.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">To create a new invoice, click on 'Record Purchases'.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135098545/original/ybsrwYQUj5O5neCM-EaUOJscDIO8g3nF-g.png?1626875320\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135098545\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Enter in the details of the invoice and click on 'Save'.</p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9135098714/original/oFf61AsukgXZ30d8zmfX_jO6Qhw9g3VFMg.png?1626875433\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9135098714\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\">Once your clients have created the invoices, they should reflect in the bookkeeping module.</p><p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204677\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204677/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote-up a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_up\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204677\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-update-with-message=\"Glad we could be helpful. Thanks for the feedback.\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes</span><span class=\"vote-down-container\"><span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000204677/thumbs_down\" class=\"vote-down a-link\" id=\"article_thumbs_down\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-remote=\"true\" data-method=\"put\" data-update=\"#vote-feedback-form\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000204677\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\"\n\t\t\t\